# Temporary git worktrees for review agents. Each is a full checkout of this
# repository living inside it — committing one would nest the repo in itself.
.claude/worktrees/
# Per-user Claude Code overrides; the shared policy is .claude/settings.json.
.claude/settings.local.json
scripts/visual/node_modules

# Visual-verification output. Regenerated by scripts/visual/capture.mjs on
# demand; 14 MB of PNGs that would be stale the moment a style changed, and
# whose verdict lives in the falsification record rather than in the images.
/screens/

# Screenshots from `pnpm web:shots` (scripts/web-shots). Regenerated on demand
# against controlled fixtures; never committed.
.web-shots/

# Results from `scripts/perf/web-nav-bench.mjs`. Evidence is summarised in
# docs/perf/web-admin-navigation.md; the raw JSON is regenerated on demand.
.perf/

# Phase 4 PR-6: exported, scrubbed customer chats for `support-ai-eval --replay`. Local files
# on the owner's machine only; the replay refuses a path inside the repository, and these
# patterns keep one from being committed by accident anyway.
/support-ai-replay/
*.replay.jsonl
*.replay.json
support-ai-replay*.json
support-ai-replay*.jsonl
